{"text":"And this time, you build the fire right. No more fire at the door, waiting for snow to drown it. You make a small fire pit in the chamber, and above it, you push a long stick up through the clay roof, between the tree roots, all the way to the snow. Then you work it around until the hole is as wide as your fist. A chimney. On top, where it comes out under the roots, you lean a flat stone over it like a tiny roof.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["A","n","d"," ","t","h","i","s"," ","t","i","m","e",","," ","y","o","u"," ","b","u","i","l","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","r","i","g","h","t","."," ","N","o"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","o","o","r",","," ","w","a","i","t","i","n","g"," ","f","o","r"," ","s","n","o","w"," ","t","o"," ","d","r","o","w","n"," ","i","t","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","m","a","k","e"," ","a"," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","p","i","t"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","h","a","m","b","e","r",","," ","a","n","d"," ","a","b","o","v","e"," ","i","t",","," ","y","o","u"," ","p","u","s","h"," ","a"," ","l","o","n","g"," ","s","t","i","c","k"," ","u","p"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","l","a","y"," ","r","o","o","f",","," ","b","e","t","w","e","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","r","e","e"," ","r","o","o","t","s",","," ","a","l","l"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","n","o","w","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","o","r","k"," ","i","t"," ","a","r","o","u","n","d"," ","u","n","t","i","l"," ","t","h","e"," ","h","o","l","e"," ","i","s"," ","a","s"," ","w","i","d","e"," ","a","s"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","f","i","s","t","."," ","A"," ","c","h","i","m","n","e","y","."," ","O","n"," ","t","o","p",","," ","w","h","e","r","e"," ","i","t"," ","c","o","m","e","s"," ","o","u","t"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","o","o","t","s",","," ","y